From: sKyissKy <29267720+sKyissKy@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] mt_wifi7: harden FT, RRM, WNM, GAS, WPS, OCE, and 6G bounds

Prevent shared RSNIE mutation, SHA-384 FT PTK truncation,
6GHz AKM bitmask pollution, and 6GHz op_class
table over-reads. Harden 802.11r FT, KDP spinlock/bounds, and RIC
length parsing; enforce WNM/BTM/ProxyARP/GAS bounds, locking, and
MLME ABI wrappers; fix RRM MIN macro, TSF sub-IE, Beacon Report bounds,
and live-packet NUL writes; and fix WPS EAP fragment underflow,
M2-M8 buffer bounds, M7 E-Hash2 verification, M8 HMAC ordering, and
encrypted IV randomization.

Signed-off-by: sKyissKy <29267720+sKyissKy@users.noreply.github.com>
